//! The `order` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property sets the order to
//! lay out an item in a flex or grid container. Items in a container are sorted by ascending `order`
//! value and then by their source code order. Items not given an explicit `order` value are assigned
//! the default value of `0`.
//!
//! Initial: 0. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Grammar: <integer>
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-display-4/#propdef-order
//!
//! Author guide: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/order
